  "description": "Fudge Messaging\n\nStand-alone messaging system that has been designed for message-passing, such as in Remote Procedure Calls (RPC) or Message Oriented Middleware (MOM). It is less suited for streaming data. Because it simply specifies the message content, it can be used with HTTP, JMS, AMQP and many other underlying transports.",
